{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"提升：Elastic Security外部告警。对应需求：外部告警接入。官方：Elastic Security External Alerts。","from":"now-2m","index":["logs-elastic_security.alert-*"],"interval":"1m","language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","max_signals":1000,"name":"【默认】提升：Elastic Security外部告警","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n提升：Elastic Security外部告警。把其他产品或模块已产生的告警提升为 Elastic Security 检测告警。\n\n### 为何重要\n可在同一告警队列调查 Endgame 或第三方安全产品结果，避免漏看外部告警。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 打开原始告警字段与厂商控制台对照。\n2. 核对主机、用户、进程、文件哈希与是否授权测试。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类提升告警与终端检测告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 授权渗透测试、IT 脚本或厂商低置信度告警\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 按原始告警置信度确认是否真实威胁。\n2. 确认恶意则隔离主机并按厂商指引处置。\n3. 必要时在源产品侧调策略，减少重复噪音。\n","references":["https://docs.elastic.co/en/integrations/elastic_security"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"720fc1aa-e195-4a1d-81d8-04edfe5313ed","rule_name_override":"kibana.alert.rule.name","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 确认对应产品数据已写入规则索引（Endgame、厂商告警索引或通用 `logs-*`）。\n2. 本规则把已有告警提升为 Elastic Security 检测告警，不替代主机检测规则。\n3. 有数据后再启用，并关注最大告警数告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: 跨平台","主题: 告警提升","来源: 默认","规则类型: 高阶","对应需求: 外部告警接入","数据源: 外部安全产品"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"event.kind: alert and data_stream.dataset: elastic_security.alert\n","risk_score_mapping":[{"field":"event.risk_score","operator":"equals","value":""}],"severity_mapping":[{"field":"event.severity","operator":"equals","severity":"low","value":"21"},{"field":"event.severity","operator":"equals","severity":"medium","value":"47"},{"field":"event.severity","operator":"equals","severity":"high","value":"73"},{"field":"event.severity","operator":"equals","severity":"critical","value":"99"}],"false_positives":["授权渗透测试、IT 脚本或厂商低置信度告警"],"related_integrations":[{"package":"elastic_security","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","event.kind","event.module","event.action","message","kibana.alert.original_event.*","source.ip","process.name","file.path"]},"version":3,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"to":"now","threat":[]}
